Z||000000||Swany||07-07-2001||01:30 AM||||Hey guys.. <P>Sorta a new member.. been reading and posting occasionally on the board for about a month.. <P>finally got the PIP downloaded and figured now would be a good time to post some pics, and say hello.. <P>I bought my first Fiero about a month ago, when my Nissan Sentra got totaled. I figured it was bout time I had the 2 seat sports car I've always wanted. I've always loved the Fiero, I remember back when they came out when I was pretty young, (I'm 24) having the Fiero slot car, and wishing I had a real one. So, instead of using my settlement check for a down payment, I decided to buy the Fiero and I couldn't be happier. <P>its an 86 GT Auto.. with 88,XXX miles on it. From what I can tell, its pretty much stock. I was having my doubts about getting the Automatic transmision, this is my first that I've owned. I've always loved having a manaul. I've been very happy with it, and haven't missed driving a stick too much.. I would have got a 4 or 5 spd but after looking at 5-6 really trashed cars, this seemed to be the best choice.. <P>Well thats my story, for the most part.. here's some pics I've taken of it.. <BR> <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/fieroforum.pip" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/fieroforum.pip</A> <P><BR> ||||reg||1
